diff -Nru gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/changelog gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/changelog
--- gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/changelog	2025-10-14 03:44:18.000000000 -0400
+++ gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/changelog	2026-02-21 02:59:55.000000000 -0500
@@ -1,3 +1,19 @@
+gnome-remote-desktop (49.0-0ubuntu1.3) questing; urgency=medium
+
+  * Fix retry limit causing permanent handover daemon death (LP: #2141992)
+    - Replace hard 30-retry limit with two-phase retries:
+      Phase 1: 30 attempts at 2s intervals (0-60s)
+      Phase 2: indefinite retries at 10s intervals (60s+)
+    - Prevents handover daemon from permanently giving up after 60s
+
+ -- Gerry Burde <gerry.burde@gmail.com>  Fri, 21 Feb 2026 03:15:00 -0500
+
+gnome-remote-desktop (49.0-0ubuntu1.2) questing; urgency=medium
+
+  * Apply mstsc handover fix (LP: #2141992)
+
+ -- Gerry Burde <gerry.burde@gmail.com>  Sat, 21 Feb 2026 00:32:17 -0500
+
 gnome-remote-desktop (49.0-0ubuntu1.1) questing; urgency=medium
 
   * d/p/lp-2127792-fix-nvenc-blackwell.patch: Fix NVENC video streaming on 
diff -Nru gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/patches/lp-2141992-mstsc-handover-fix.patch gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/patches/lp-2141992-mstsc-handover-fix.patch
--- gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/patches/lp-2141992-mstsc-handover-fix.patch	1969-12-31 19:00:00.000000000 -0500
+++ gnome-remote-desktop-49.0/debian/patches/lp-2141992-mstsc-handover-fix.patch	2026-02-21 03:03:10.000000000 -0500
@@ -0,0 +1,661 @@
+Description: <short summary of the patch>
+ TODO: Put a short summary on the line above and replace this paragraph
+ with a longer explanation of this change. Complete the meta-information
+ with other relevant fields (see below for details). To make it easier, the
+ information below has been extracted from the changelog. Adjust it or drop
+ it.
+ .
+ gnome-remote-desktop (49.0-0ubuntu1.3) questing; urgency=medium
+ .
+   * Fix retry limit causing permanent handover daemon death (LP: #2141992)
+     - Replace hard 30-retry limit with two-phase retries:
+       Phase 1: 30 attempts at 2s intervals (0-60s)
+       Phase 2: indefinite retries at 10s intervals (60s+)
+     - Prevents handover daemon from permanently giving up after 60s
+Author: Gerry Burde <gerry.burde@gmail.com>
+Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2141992
+
+---
+The information above should follow the Patch Tagging Guidelines, please
+checkout https://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/ to learn about the format. Here
+are templates for supplementary fields that you might want to add:
+
+Origin: (upstream|backport|vendor|other), (<patch-url>|commit:<commit-id>)
+Bug: <upstream-bugtracker-url>
+Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/<bugnumber>
+Bug-Ubuntu: https://launchpad.net/bugs/<bugnumber>
+Forwarded: (no|not-needed|<patch-forwarded-url>)
+Applied-Upstream: <version>, (<commit-url>|commit:<commid-id>)
+Reviewed-By: <name and email of someone who approved/reviewed the patch>
+Last-Update: 2026-02-21
